## About the standard

EN 303 645 sets baseline cybersecurity requirements for internet-connected consumer products, such as password handling, vulnerability management and data protection. It underpins several national and European requirement frameworks and is free from ETSI.

Official source: [ETSI EN 303 645](https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/303600_303699/303645/).

